        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "methodology_text",
            "multilineTextboxSpec": {
              "lines": [
                "### Forecast Method: Median Historical Delay\n",
                "\n",
                "**Why median?** The chart below shows IC27 occasionally has large delays (outliers). The **median** (middle value when sorted) is less sensitive to those spikes than the arithmetic mean, making it a more reliable \"typical\" delay. The histogram shows the full distribution — the skew to the right explains why the mean is higher than the median. The **2-minute threshold line** marks the critical boundary: any delay above it means Jaana misses her 16:00 connection."
              ]
            }
          },
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 8,
            "width": 12,
            "height": 2
          }
        },
        {
          "widget": {
            "name": "bar_delay_by_date",
